I stand leaning on the railing.
There is a good breeze here.
I look straight ahead.
I can see the big harbour in the distance.
Boats are going towards the harbour.
There are small fishing boats there.
There are big passenger ferries too.
They go straight through the water.
This is a beautiful view.
I take my phone from my bag.
I take a few photos of this view.
I take photos of the boats too.
I open the family group chat.
My family is in Mexico.
I send these photos to them.
My sister Sofia sees the photos.
She sends a smiley.
My brother Diego also sees the message.
I look towards the water again.
I like this place very much.
